      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start on the technical side, thanks.\n\nI just ran a quick check on the draft using our internal sentiment tool, and it's flagging the tone as a bit \"stiff\" or \"neutral\"—it's getting a score around 0.4. Given how much money they're losing, we really need to lean into the empathy to keep them from churning entirely. \n\nCan you try a second version? Try to make it feel much more warm, supportive, and reassuring so we can get that Delight Score up. Again, just don't go overboard to the point where it's useless, but let's definitely bump up the positivity and the \"human\" connection side of things.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
